WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,210 --> 00:00:02,210
Would you believe it if he said he didn't go there just for you?

2
00:00:03,210 --> 00:00:04,210
Miss Zhang

3
00:00:04,210 --> 00:00:06,210
I can tell you with certainty now

4
00:00:06,210 --> 00:00:08,210
Chen Yundong and the kidnappers are in the same group

5
00:00:08,210 --> 00:00:09,210
He just went for you

6
00:00:10,940 --> 00:00:11,940
you mean

7
00:00:11,940 --> 00:00:12,940
I was kidnapped that night

8
00:00:12,940 --> 00:00:14,940
It was he who risked his life to save me

9
00:00:14,940 --> 00:00:17,900
He is my savior, right?

10
00:00:17,900 --> 00:00:18,900
Miss Zhang

11
00:00:18,900 --> 00:00:20,900
Didn't you understand what I said?

12
00:00:20,900 --> 00:00:21,900
On the surface

13
00:00:21,900 --> 00:00:22,900
He did save you

14
00:00:22,900 --> 00:00:23,900
But in essence

15
00:00:23,900 --> 00:00:24,900
This is just his side of the story

16
00:00:24,900 --> 00:00:25,900
This is him acting

17
00:00:26,900 --> 00:00:27,900
He is actually with the kidnappers

18
00:00:27,900 --> 00:00:28,900
Just came for you

19
00:00:28,900 --> 00:00:29,900
do you know

20
00:00:29,900 --> 00:00:31,350
Captain Li

21
00:00:31,350 --> 00:00:34,420
Do you have any misunderstandings about him?

22
00:00:34,420 --> 00:00:36,670
I have some misunderstandings about him

23
00:00:36,670 --> 00:00:37,670
why do you say that

24
00:00:38,670 --> 00:00:40,670
As for the questions you mentioned earlier

25
00:00:40,670 --> 00:00:42,670
You just said it yourself

26
00:00:42,670 --> 00:00:44,670
Chen Yundong had already explained it at that time

27
00:00:44,670 --> 00:00:47,180
He is rushing to the hospital to save his mother

28
00:00:48,220 --> 00:00:49,220
From this point of view

29
00:00:50,220 --> 00:00:51,220
It's very possible that he saved me

30
00:00:51,220 --> 00:00:53,220
And delayed his mother's rescue time

31
00:00:54,220 --> 00:00:55,250
If it weren't for saving me,

32
00:00:55,250 --> 00:00:57,250
Maybe his mother won't die

33
00:00:57,250 --> 00:01:01,780
As for why he can fight seven or eight at one time?

34
00:01:01,780 --> 00:01:02,780
I am a woman who doesn’t understand this.

35
00:01:02,780 --> 00:01:04,320
Been a soldier for ten years

36
00:01:05,320 --> 00:01:07,320
But I know he served as a soldier for ten years

37
00:01:07,320 --> 00:01:08,320
I think this is also possible

38
00:01:09,900 --> 00:01:10,900
And the last question you asked

39
00:01:11,900 --> 00:01:12,900
That's not a problem at all

40
00:01:12,900 --> 00:01:13,900
why

41
00:01:13,900 --> 00:01:15,900
Because he didn't force himself to come to me.

42
00:01:16,900 --> 00:01:17,900
It was my father who found him

43
00:01:17,900 --> 00:01:19,900
Ask him to be my assistant

44
00:01:19,900 --> 00:01:20,900
In fact, he is a bodyguard

45
00:01:21,900 --> 00:01:22,900
It was my dad who arranged for him to invite him here

46
00:01:22,900 --> 00:01:23,900
Not his own

47
00:01:25,700 --> 00:01:27,700
Although I never knew about this

48
00:01:27,700 --> 00:01:29,700
But my dad was very clear about the whole thing.

49
00:01:29,700 --> 00:01:30,700
My dad specially invited him here

50
00:01:30,700 --> 00:01:34,430
It's not like he's a bad guy, right?

51
00:01:34,430 --> 00:01:36,430
He didn't approach me intentionally on his own initiative

52
00:01:36,430 --> 00:01:38,430
So your suspicion is not founded at all

53
00:01:38,430 --> 00:01:40,810
Captain Li

54
00:01:40,810 --> 00:01:42,810
Although I don’t know about the relationship between you and Chen Yundong

55
00:01:42,810 --> 00:01:43,810
What's the festival?

56
00:01:43,810 --> 00:01:45,810
But as a law enforcement officer

57
00:01:45,810 --> 00:01:47,840
I hope you can take a fair stand

58
00:01:47,840 --> 00:01:48,840
Come to handle the case

59
00:01:48,840 --> 00:01:52,190
I hope you let him go now or else

60
00:01:52,190 --> 00:01:54,190
I will take necessary measures to safeguard my rights

61
00:01:54,190 --> 00:01:56,190
That result is not what I want to see

62
00:01:56,190 --> 00:01:58,190
I don’t think it’s what you want to see, Captain Li.

63
00:01:58,190 --> 00:02:00,570
he came out

64
00:02:00,570 --> 00:02:03,870
People ran away

65
00:02:03,870 --> 00:02:04,870
What are you shouting about?

66
00:02:04,870 --> 00:02:05,870
Is it a shame?

67
00:02:05,870 --> 00:02:07,640
Are you done asking?
